    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/dabb632ca0147d1398d142b22175b96e.poster.avif?t=1755478958\" width=600 height=323 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/dabb632ca0147d1398d142b22175b96e.webm?t=1755478958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/f583156890b29384cccd695ced784513.poster.avif?t=1755478958\" width=600 height=323 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/f583156890b29384cccd695ced784513.webm?t=1755478958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 43.8m+ frogs combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/2e8a5695f17a8a7fa1d721a33639eb36.poster.avif?t=1755478958\" width=600 height=323 ><source 